  "body": "`<caption>` should have `text-align: center` by default (but not align\ndescendants to center), and `align=left/center/right/justify` should\nhave no effect. `align=bottom` still maps to `caption-side: bottom`.\n\nFixes #370.\n\n---\n\ncc @dbaron\n",
